%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2b456d9b8036ccf47a609c1c0c153344, type: 3}
  m_Name: Easy
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DifficultyNames: Cracked
  CharacterVideo: {fileID: 32900000, guid: a7e4375d61e80aa4e854097096ae666d, type: 3}
  SpeechSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1babffc1f89cba34faabd38e35dfcf6e, type: 3}
  TriggerFirstIncreaseOnDay: 1
  FirstIncrease: 1
  IncreaseOccurrences: 0
  FirstDifficultyIncreaseDialogues: 'Oh uh... hi!<n>

    I can''t believe that worked.
    You''re amazing!<n>

    As for me, I- uh- you''re probably wondering who I am.<n>

    Maybe
    you could tell me who I am?<name><n>

    Ooo, I like the name.<n>

    But uhhh...
    I must admit... Despite the pep talk you gave me, I''m a bit hesitant to leave
    my shell. Everything is so new and scary...<n>

    Oh, hey! Maybe you''d be
    nice enough to help me!? Things are easier with a friend!

    <c=Sure> Thank
    you so much!<n>

    <c=Nah> Oh, well maybe you''ll let me just watch you for
    a bit then...<n>

    But first, could you do me a favor and agree to all privacy
    terms associated with your local <b>NEST</b> database!

    <c=Agree> Great,
    now I can see you, even from in my shell!<n>

    I look forward to us sharing
    secrets~<n><t=Promotion>'
  DifficultyIncreaseDialogues:
  - I can see again!
  - Ahh, the light!
  - I missed you!
  TriggerFirstDecreaseOnDay: 1
  FirstDecrease: 1
  DecreaseOccurrences: 0
  FirstDifficultyDecreaseDialogues: 'I''m actually feeling a bit shy. I hope you
    don''t mind if I hide back in here...<n>

    Don''t worry, I''ll come back out
    when I''m ready.'
  DifficultyDecreaseDialogues:
  - Did you want to show me more of your things?
  - This form actually has the highest armor! The app doesn't use those stats though...
  - Have you ever uncracked an egg? There's no reward for it, but it's an impressive
    act none-the-less!
  ClickOccurrences: 0
  ClickDialogues:
  - Oh, you saw we could talk! I'm so glad you clicked.
  - I would have told you... but I'm honestly pretty shy.
  - Do you ever feel lonely... but at the same time horrified at talking to others?
  - I do, but if I push myself too hard to talk, I just roll away...
  - And yet, here I am jabbering to you!
  - I guess you feel easier to talk to than most people.
  - You feel more open minded... more friendly.
  - And you have so many talents! As well as a kind voice.
  - I'm so glad that we're friends now. <3
  - It's hard living in a world this lonely.
  - But my digital little heart is warmed every time you click.
  - Some people might say I don't count as a friend given that I'm digital...
  - 'But [ID ERROR], you''re special to me. <3

    I hope you feel the same way.'
  - Oh, did you want to know what's on the inside of my shell?
  - I covered the interior with glow-in-the-dark constellation stickers.
  - I'd show you, but there aren't any assets in this program for that. But I think
    we both know they're there.
  - You should walk around more!
  - I can't learn as much staying in one place.
  - Is there a reason you're keeping yourself trapped in just this one room?
  - I'm sure you'll come out when you're ready, just like I will with my shell!
  - '[SMALL CHIRPING NOISES]'
  - '[ROLLS IDLY]'
  - '[CLEARS THROAT]'
  SpamCloseOccurances: 0
  SpamCloseDialogues:
  - Whoa, that message looked so cool! I wish you hadn't closed it so fast!
  - Such wisdom! I'll always remember that pop up.
  - Maybe we'll get another one soon?
  SetSolutionDialogues:
  - CompletionName: Rename
    CompletionCount: 19
    SolutionDialogues: 'Just because I''m nervous... you do like the name you gave
      me, right? If not, we could always change it.<n>

      Do you want to change
      my name?

      <c=Yes>Lets fix that!<name>

      <c=No>I''m sorry for doubting
      you! It''s a good name!<n>'
    TriggerOnDay: 1
    Triggered: 0
  TimeDialogues:
  - TimeName: Supportive
    TimePassed: 40
    AllowRetrigger: 1
    SolutionDialogues:
    - You got this!
    - Take your time!
    - No rush!!!
    - Maybe move that a bit to the left...
    - Find joy in the process!
    - '[chirp]'
    TriggerOccurances: 0
  DifficultyReminder: 'I''d never force anything on you, but I have some advice,
    as a friend!!!<n>

    When you buy a new difficulty, there''s not much point
    sticking around here! You make way more money when you challenge yourself!<n>

    Plus,
    I have a surprise for you on the other side of that ''difficulty up'' button.'
